[{"client_msg_id":"865f95a1-7d03-4ef9-89de-d51d6e589639","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今は多分destructuring？","ts":"1627987560.084600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k9l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4eaa905f-5c32-4ce8-a153-f9107fccb1db","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"毎回、自分が今しゃべっているのは spread 構文なのか、destructuring 構文なのかまったくわからない。","ts":"1627987482.084200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kElAf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5773cee3-0469-47a0-9cf7-4c1122789f27","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"React コンポーネント以外でもほとんど関数の引数を spread で取るのはやめてしまったな。","ts":"1627987201.083700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wrq0w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3216810f-ef5d-4fc0-b56f-07859c5cfa2e","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"使い回す時は `const { foo } = props` するかなぁ。","ts":"1627987172.083000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Q4n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4409f3a2-f669-4880-b2e4-2955ce93ed9e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"一般的にやることが多そうだからやっているけど・・・","ts":"1627987146.082500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5RJ5y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"533dd096-2848-43d4-bd8d-ad66cd4ae2c6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"propsに限ってやらないのは気持ち分かる","ts":"1627987126.082000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uvv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0a972fe-ece8-454d-b13f-01bc79e97b54","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そういうケースではやりますー。","ts":"1627987103.081700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CTW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ec65cca-07d0-4bd6-b24e-4adb6ba8684c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Custom Hooks使う時とかはやりますよね多分","ts":"1627987092.081400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3UY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fde5840f-dabb-4966-a910-4742a85c9859","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあでも少なくともさっきのような型を絞り込むケースだと、そもそも spread すると死ぬので :totemoturai:","ts":"1627987077.081000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"05lO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fce8cabc-df9c-4892-b0a6-15cb1af07c28","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あえて `const { foo } = props` を別途書く。とかもやっていない。","ts":"1627987058.080400","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1627987067.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=FLL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"793cc804-9f28-415d-b0b2-8a15ca66b944","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"props で受け取ったら、割と `props.className` とか参照してますね。","ts":"1627987037.079700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LAzj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ead73b19-21be-468b-b855-80b9de40d9b0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`const { foo } = args` もしないです？","ts":"1627987017.079400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MXRd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d9b66a5-9345-49b2-bcaa-881aa0ad0019","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ちなみに自分は引数の数が多くなると割と spread で書きます","ts":"1627986960.078800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Frc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a466c16-daea-4ee3-80db-8e82a7cc221a","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"順番を気にしなくていいくらいかなぁ。","ts":"1627986892.078300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BFg6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"596d8721-4a89-48a5-b901-bf3c88506d89","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あ、一般的なのは spread で取る方だと思います！個人的にやめたという感じです。。。","ts":"1627986880.078000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GXux"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a5953ed-0875-4553-9caa-5c3ddf6e5825","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"React の Component の props とかは spread で受け取るものかと思ってました。最近始めたので何が一般的なのかよくわかってないですが…","ts":"1627986839.077400","edited":{"user":"U03C71D7H","ts":"1627986850.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5G+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28a89940-4f02-470f-b30f-30e001095f12","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"個人的に引数を spread で受け取るのはもうやめました。メリットがほぼ感じられなかった。","ts":"1627986574.076500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WGCV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c838f38-d579-46e9-b0bb-6c4622e208c2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーん\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/jovi0608/status/1422476390910201858\u003e","ts":"1627986562.076100","thread_ts":"1627986562.076100","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/jovi0608|@jovi0608\u003e: axiosのプロジェクト状況について \u003chttps://twitter.com/koh110|@koh110\u003e が問題提起しています。axiosを使われている方はぜひ一読を。\n\u003chttps://github.com/axios/axios/issues/3930\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"Shigeki Ohtsu","author_subname":"@jovi0608","author_link":"https://twitter.com/jovi0608/status/1422476390910201858","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/417300648346939393/7vCUG7nT_normal.jpeg","text":"axiosのプロジェクト状況について \u003chttps://twitter.com/koh110|@koh110\u003e が問題提起しています。axiosを使われている方はぜひ一読を。\n\u003chttps://github.com/axios/axios/issues/3930\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1627979774,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/jovi0608/status/1422476390910201858","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jovi0608/status/1422476390910201858"}],"reply_count":14,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V2JQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cacb4e51-1c8a-4bb8-b7ab-80d60632444b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`function foo\u0026lt;T extends Hoge | Fuga\u0026gt;({ type, value }: T) {` こう書けなくなるってことなので、不便…","ts":"1627986467.075700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RRHQv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F1F8BC14-3534-4017-A030-DA0F57BB4994","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"巻き上げ〜","ts":"1627986340.075000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g6//q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2af4cbf-fd38-46de-805c-d6a2214cf2e8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"遡って推論してくれない…","ts":"1627983952.074700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EUF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c39cb67-d7a6-496b-9f22-d27ae6ccdf9a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あーでも、ちょっと別のケースかもしれない。","ts":"1627983388.073700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kWi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f94f4ff1-7685-43b8-a2d5-04fd57368415","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"型確定前に引いてるから、string | number になってる?","ts":"1627983373.073400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mdyI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f01452d-5ab6-4202-8c1c-3e2ae77aa1e8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"それは uhyo さんが PR 出していた気がする。","ts":"1627983368.073100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BaU4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5fbb5a2b-c00d-48ba-8e60-177fb8e76c5f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"```type Hoge = {\n  type: 'hoge'\n  value: '1',\n}\ntype Fuga = {\n  type: 'fuga'\n  value: 2,\n}\nfunction foo\u0026lt;T extends Hoge | Fuga\u0026gt;(hogeOrFuga: T) {\n  const value = hogeOrFuga.value;\n  if (hogeOrFuga.type == 'hoge') {\n    needsString(value);\n  } else {\n    needsNumber(value);\n  }\n}\nconst needsString = (_: string) =\u0026gt; {}\nconst needsNumber = (_: number) =\u0026gt; {}```\nこうした途端にエラーになるのも解せぬ","ts":"1627983196.072600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fard"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0637a869-a94b-4696-b918-dcbd5bdeb72e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"戻り値に関しては切り分けられるはずですが、実装側で切り分けられるいいサンプルが浮かばないし、もしかしたら全くできないのかも。。。（できるケースはあった気がするんですが。。。）","ts":"1627983164.072100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tvf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9faa6066-a512-46ee-8872-02a51477ce75","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"別の変数の型に明示的に適用することはできない感じですよね","ts":"1627983031.070900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dc8U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"326a15ee-6a4b-4142-9918-efd8ae8983f4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"今回はこれの `hogeOrFuga.type === 'hoge'` の部分を isNullable にやらせて、さらに conditional type で型同士を連携すれば推論してくれるかな。と思ったが、だめだった感じでした。","ts":"1627983011.070400","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1627983022.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZyV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94133950-cd17-4060-a217-459f1844bb3e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"type が `hoge` の場合は、value が string だとわかっているので、needsString が呼び出せる。","ts":"1627982925.069400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bgg3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43949b5c-87f6-454c-a052-a1f1af9c806d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"こういう感じです。\n```type Hoge = {\n  type: 'hoge'\n  value: '1',\n}\n\ntype Fuga = {\n  type: 'fuga'\n  value: 2,\n}\n\nfunction foo\u0026lt;T extends Hoge | Fuga\u0026gt;(hogeOrFuga: T) {\n  if (hogeOrFuga.type == 'hoge') {\n    needsString(hogeOrFuga.value);\n  } else {\n    needsNumber(hogeOrFuga.value);\n  }\n}\n\nconst needsString = (_: string) =\u0026gt; {}\nconst needsNumber = (_: number) =\u0026gt; {}```","ts":"1627982892.068800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pwax"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d012550-9d08-4220-b58e-eed87b974b6b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"むむ、そうなんですか…今後の TS に期待、なのかな…","ts":"1627982832.068600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"asEK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22cdc789-dcfa-4960-9799-64d112b4b460","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"いえ、コード上から明確な場合は推論してくれる場合もあるんですよね。","ts":"1627982779.068200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r6r4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5209bad5-4d54-40dd-a87d-4608e83ac80c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実行時の値を見ないと決定できないのが敗因な気がしています…型レベルのことは型レベルで決定できないとダメっぽそうな","ts":"1627982713.067900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hGnk5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f664f792-bd4d-452d-9957-1c55663887a6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"「ある型に応じて、特定の型を変化させたい」→ conditional type or mapped type\nどっちも試してみましたがだめでしたね。","ts":"1627982558.067000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H54+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04cb4e58-4eec-4a90-a7bb-4f081b557867","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"とは言えできないもんはできないっぽいのでそろそろ落とし所を決めないといかん…なんとかしようと思います。みなさんアドバイスありがとうございます！","ts":"1627982502.066300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cb2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffabb2f8-e580-40ff-b461-fbb8150f20fb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"引き回すのとはちょっと違うか…別の callback が呼ばれた際にこの callback を呼ぶようにするので、その度に if で分岐するんですか?? みたいに私の中でなってます…","ts":"1627982415.065500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6rJaM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"610d738f-1507-4b89-ab3c-f5d7382107c4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そうですね。あと callback の呼び出しを 1 回にしたいところ…実際にはこの callback は更に下位に引き回す","ts":"1627982332.064500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OE1ux"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8db3811f-261c-415b-9e61-b0a6619bd60a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```class a {\n  foo(isNullable: true, callback: () =\u0026gt; void): void;\n  foo(isNullable: false, callback: (arg: Hoge) =\u0026gt; void): void;\n  foo(isNullable: boolean, callback: (arg?: Hoge) =\u0026gt; void) {\n    if (isNullable) {\n      callback();\n    } else {\n      callback();\n    }\n  }\n}```\nこれが通ってしまうので foo の内部実装においてはまだ callback への引数渡し忘れがある感じかもですね。（呼び出し側はいい感じになりそうな気はしますが）\nただ、呼び出し側はそもそもコールバックが引数を受け取ろうが受け取るまいが自由なんですよね。","ts":"1627982251.063300","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1627982263.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K2C1"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"このエラーを消したいって意味か、理解しました","ts":"1627982231.062700","files":[{"id":"F02A0825H6E","created":1627982220,"timestamp":1627982220,"name":"CleanShot 2021-08-03 at 18.16.53.png","title":"CleanShot 2021-08-03 at 18.16.53.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U776661HA","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":28966,"url":"","url_download":"","url_priva