delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IsR5S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65968a70-197c-4315-81dd-249d1515b6fe","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"```foo(isNullable: true, callback: (arg: Hoge | null) =\u0026gt; void))\nfoo(isNullable: false, callback: (arg: Hoge) =\u0026gt; void))\nfoo(isNullable: boolean, callback: (arg: Hoge | null) =\u0026gt; void) {\n}```\nという意味です？","ts":"1627981875.061100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fEx4w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b97f46a-a6f7-480f-b243-3c9a238da55f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実装の中では `arg` は nullable にならないんですよね","ts":"1627981827.060400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ztOl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c95ae626-46e6-46ca-ae52-60b6c8444e60","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"```foo(isNullable: true, callback: null | (arg: Hoge) =\u0026gt; void))\nfoo(isNullable: false, callback: (arg: Hoge) =\u0026gt; void))\nfoo(isNullable: boolean, callback: null | (arg: Hoge) =\u0026gt; void) {\n}```\nって書けないんでしたっけ？","ts":"1627981776.060000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y85C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a87ca97-aed3-40cf-b600-f818e1793b74","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それなんですよ…","ts":"1627981689.058700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"npdb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9480cded-6150-4cb6-aebd-6a1cfffa5b80","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"最も素朴に書いた JS に対して型だけで安全にしたい。という気持ちすごいわかる。","ts":"1627981675.058500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VTni"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e415662-e77e-49e5-8571-60e90605bea1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"(arg が配列になっちゃったけどまあそこまで変わらないはず)","ts":"1627981563.057900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YsX6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f5a75ab-47f1-497b-9675-a460eed6cbc0","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"```const arg = ['foo', 'bar'];\nif (isNullable) {\n  arg.splice(0, 0, null);\n}\ncallback(arg);```\nこういうイメージ。なので isNullable によって arg 自体の型を変えられればなぁ…という感じでした","ts":"1627981505.057100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HrI=z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99ee0791-1a15-4c31-a6ae-a568700dadbd","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あの関数用意して〜　とかはたしかに蛇足感はありますよね。","ts":"1627981420.055900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lkecj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6004b04a-1a2f-43f0-8863-36537922c4e8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あー isNullable での分岐はするんですけど、それ以外の部分では不要","ts":"1627981405.055300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OHgRi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aeb62c55-bf37-4bd2-84da-f93ce0c33b22","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ちなみに、JS だったとしてもおそらく if は必要ですよね。","ts":"1627981338.054700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ps8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ec205ff-7859-480a-9f9d-460a16407341","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"自分が踏んでるのはこれですね。今の TypeScript では generics の constraints の可能性を narrowing できないみたいです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/42077#issuecomment-750899278\u003e","ts":"1627981268.054000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/42077#issuecomment-750899278|Comment on #42077 Generic type param not narrowed in true branch of conditional type\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/42077#issuecomment-750899278|Comment on #42077 Generic type param not narrowed in true branch of conditional type\u003e","text":"It seems that this example illustrates the same point. It was unclear to me why `test2` is behaving differently until I saw Ryan's reply above.\n\n```\nfunction test1(input: boolean) {\n    if (input === true) {\n        throw new Error(\"!\")\n    }\n    needsFalse(input) // OK, expected\n}\n\nfunction test2\u0026lt;T extends boolean\u0026gt;(input: T) {\n    if (input === true) {\n        throw new Error(\"!\")\n    }\n    needsFalse(input)\n    /**\n     * Argument of type 'T' is not assignable to parameter of type 'false'.\n     *   Type 'boolean' is not assignable to type 'false'.(2345)\n     */\n}\n\ndeclare function needsFalse(input: false): void\n```\n\nI need a generic there to eventually write a conditional return type based on the function parameter.","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript|microsoft/TypeScript\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1608820491}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=yf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef67ab15-e584-4da0-8392-022edc429ef1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実行時に type guard if で処理自体を分岐すればたぶん行けるのだけど、そもそも JS だったら不要だった分岐が TS になった途端に発生するのは敗北感しかない","ts":"1627981232.053300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q4qZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a79b7b65-3700-42af-8142-18eb143e4383","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Conditional Types の仕様を見直しているけど、実行時に引数に渡ってきた値の型を元に型を分岐するのは無理なんじゃないかという気がしてきた…","ts":"1627981048.052100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bu4QX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08803630-0ad0-4ab9-b5e5-2d50004ae750","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"動いてほしかったもの。\n```type Hoge = {\n  type: 'hoge'\n}\n\nconst foo = \u0026lt;IsNullable extends true | false\u0026gt;(isNullable: IsNullable, callback: IsNullable extends true ? () =\u0026gt; void : (arg: Hoge) =\u0026gt; void) =\u0026gt; {\n  if (isNullable) {\n    callback();\n  } else {\n    callback({ type: 'hoge' });\n  }\n}```","ts":"1627980893.050900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CWZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4196302-cb2c-4b75-a39c-602e8e7ad2e2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"うーん。できる気がしなくなってきました。","ts":"1627980790.050500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q2OM/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72595d97-2079-4064-af8f-508aef2a877c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ああ、違うか。。。","ts":"1627980780.050200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zk9Pt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f60b951-ae00-4370-b50b-6e42f1d392bc","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"やっぱり overload っぽい。","ts":"1627980745.049800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3=qB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"baca7869-b600-494e-baac-ae93bc9f3adb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そうですね。理想を言えばコード上では分岐をせずに callback に渡す変数の型自体を動的に変えられると嬉しかったんですけど、難しそうですかね…妥協しないとダメな気がしてきました","ts":"1627980318.048700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KEOo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e989e1d-adf1-4c4e-9cba-3f4fe7d510e0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"意外とむつかしい","ts":"1627980281.047900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lLyLG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C917AA86-406F-4ECA-ACC6-FA9DE72375AE","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"多分、慣例的にコールバックは、個別かつ最後の引数にしたいんだと思う","ts":"1627980210.047000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01QD3YAUMP"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XC5JM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8f3b47f-8cba-47b1-ac88-0cd53a0cb29f","type":"message","user":"U01QD3YAUMP","text":"```type T = { isNullable: true, callback: (arg: number | undefined) =\u0026gt; void }  | { isNullable: false, callback: (arg: number) =\u0026gt; void }\n\nfunction f(t: T) {\n    if (t.isNullable) {\n        t.callback(undefined) // OK\n    } else {\n        t.callback(undefined) // NG\n    }\n}```\nこういうことではないですか？","ts":"1627980091.045600","thread_ts":"1627979920.044300","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wwvx"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"1497a6de-9de8-45c0-b195-363cdcf10478","type":"message","user":"U01QD3YAUMP","text":"`{ isNullable: true, callback: (arg: Hoge | undefined) =\u0026gt; void } | { isNullable: false, callback: (arg: Hoge) =\u0026gt; void }` みたいにセットにしてあれるといけるかなとおもいました。","ts":"1627979920.044300","thread_ts":"1627979920.044300","edited":{"user":"U01QD3YAUMP","ts":"1627979999.000000"},"last_read":"1627980091.045600","subscribed":true,"reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qc1K"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"8199e71b-16f8-4600-80ae-e8576769c582","type":"message","user":"UCL78DG68","text":"\u0026gt; ある関数が `A | B` を受け取る時に、受け取った値が `A` だったか `B` だったかで内部で扱う別の変数の型を変えたい\nuser defined type guard使って書くとこんな感じだと思うのですがどうでしょう\n\u003chttps://www.typescriptlang.org/play?#code/JYOwLgpgTgZghgYwgAgILIN4Chm+SOAWwgC5kBnMKUAcwG4sBfLLUSWRFAIUxzzGBgANqQpVaDZlhgBXEAgEB7EMmDlUACkERCZdAB9kXAJRlthVeTS9cUCGBlQV5gHQALOOQDyAdxAAFKEUAB2gwAE8NACICYijjSRZZeSUVGnsASUhCADkiCC1svWRDExtVGGQtdUKdY2Ny23tHZ2yXWIgGXEZkCCFyFGw8ZDsHJ1U2gWFOvmZGIA|https://www.typescriptlang.org/play?#code/JYOwLgpgTgZghgYwgAgILIN4Chm+SOAWwgC5kBnMKUAcwG4sB[…]GGQtdUKdY2Ny23